<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai authorities are intensifying security and economic measures in the southern insurgency zone, seizing millions of meth pills after an armed clash with border troops and arresting high-profile suspects in a cross-border money-laundering and stock-market scandal, while also issuing 46 warrants in a citizenship-fraud probe. The government is tightening data-centre regulations as applications surge and proposing a 15‑day visa-free entry for three countries alongside digital border passes at Mae Sai under the BLOOM settlement scheme. Malaysia and Thailand have agreed to improve security, travel and trade, targeting US$30bn trade by 2027, and the Thai army has rejected Cambodia's claims over border barriers and displaced residents. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chosunbiz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxQZ0xEc0did0Z0c19BWjhfaVoxVGRLeWVvX2kycGdlTmRrcHlYQTB2aGcwWUhIOXNFM2liQkl6OGFlczV4X2YxSWtqUXB2Ny1LQUxhM0VtWUhKOW5hYUdtNEtTeEVfMVZnODFhdkw1WnJQaGdnbEI5Vkk3MTJ4RVFGTXd0TXZ5RUlpRnFIR01OSlNiVWZtcUVfNjJSbVZkWlY5cDcwQlRlOE5uTnFNT09TVFVIYUszbTY2MkJZTkZadlN0NVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOWFR4WXBMR0Z1Ti05Mm8tNEFraURwaWdFdnRNVzBod0I2b3NSQzJkNzRUV1d1OFJIRHZFaXR0S0J6U0NjbktMQmRwNFJVamxoNjhMcGR4LU9yNENvcXRmT2laVW95Sm9veXFEYXo1WDZwZG1qc04yMWliNUo4Q0w5Tjh5Zk9qY05jR2N2ZkI3LTVwVEhOdVRkMEltQlgydlZReGNYR2xuVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTE5VZlVZTEhxbmsxRDZ6T2p6NWV4RzdBdDU1Z2V1VVJwbGkyRkJTTUM3ZzZ3QWh4dENRN1RiVlNxd3YwZ24zUVZsUXVMM2l4R0dmXzBPb1JnQlJaa1ZwT19GdEJsSVc?oc=5&quot;&gt;